The legal text comes from the official consolidated legislation of the Ministry of Justice and Courts Administration of Samoa (https://mjca.gov.ws/legislation/legislation.html), retrieved on 29 October 2026: Constitution of the Independent State of Samoa 1960, official version as at 31 December 2024. The Ministry states no licence for the legal texts. They are official legal texts; their copyright status is not confirmed here, and they are reproduced with the attribution above.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line; spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; running heads and page numbers were removed; and the text was arranged as git commits. The wording of the law was not changed. The Ministry of Justice and Courts Administration of Samoa does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
